5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's actually like for people! Can we look at the next lane and the station block's bin house?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried about the costs. I'll check the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's see why people are complaining. I'll look at the ward complaint log for this point and the station block's meeting minutes.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know the time commitment. I'll check the supervised mornings on the next lane and the truck arrival time from the crew leader.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Fairness is key. I will look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
