25,2,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
26,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
27,2,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
28,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
29,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Rin,,The bin house at the station block smells really bad in summer! And the supervised mornings take almost an hour.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Shelters are expensive, over two hundred thousand yen, though there is a subsidy. We also spend thirty-four thousand yearly on maintenance.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Most complaints come from the person whose gate the bins are by. Also, the station block fought over repairs and cleaning.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"The truck comes quite early, between 7:40 and 8:15. Those supervised mornings are about fifty minutes each.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Not all our frontages are equal; one is very narrow and another has a driveway. Also, filing for a build takes four months.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If it smells that bad, we shouldn't build a box! That would be a disaster for the summer.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. And the cost of building one seems quite high for some of us to handle.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,It seems the current location is the main source of friction. We need to address that specifically.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"Fifty minutes every few weeks isn't too bad, but that early truck time might be a problem for some.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"Moving it frequently would require constant notices to the ward, which is a bureaucratic headache.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Rin,,"But if we just leave it there, the person at the gate stays sad!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Midori,,"True, but we must find a solution that doesn't break our budgets or our friendships.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we rotate it, we might just move the argument around the block instead of solving it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,I just don't want one person doing all the work. A schedule would be fairer.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"A rotation is only fair if the spaces are equal, which they aren't. Some spots are too narrow.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Rin,,I don't like the idea of standing there in the morning. It sounds boring.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Midori,,Maybe we can find a middle ground that isn't too expensive or too demanding.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,We have to weigh the smell and the cost against the fairness of the location.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,May,,Let's see what the actual options are before we decide.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Let's look at the formal proposals.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,3,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
51,3,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
