54,3,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
55,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option A is supervised hours, B is rotating the spot, and C is building a structure. I hate C because of the smell!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option C is too expensive. Option A seems okay, but who will actually do the supervising?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option B solves the gate complaint, but Asuka mentioned the frontage sizes. That could cause new fights.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,Option A takes about twenty hours a year per house. That's manageable if we share it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option B is problematic because of the driveway and the narrow pavement. Option A keeps it in one place.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Rin,,"I vote for B! It's like a game, moving the bins around!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'm leaning towards A. It's the most affordable and doesn't require construction.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,A is the safest for our relationships. It doesn't force the bins onto a narrow path.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,May,,I prefer A. It's a clear time commitment and doesn't involve expensive building.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I also vote for A. It's the most logical given the physical constraints of our houses.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Rin,,But A is boring! Why can't we just move them?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Midori,,We have to think about the neighbors who might struggle with the cost of a structure.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,The stability of Option A is better for the long term.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,May,,It's the most balanced choice for everyone's schedule.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Asuka,,It avoids the legal and spatial issues of the other two.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Rin,,"Fine, but I'm not doing the early shift!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Midori,,We can work out a fair schedule together.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I think we have a consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,May,,Let's vote.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I'm ready.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
